"Usage of wireprobe:\n  -account-options string\n    \tsparse current-client account option overrides; other defaults remain client-owned\n  -advertise-host string\n    \thost the client dials for the game and channel directory; empty reuses the bound address, or auto-detects the LAN IPv4 when game-listen is a wildcard\n  -apocalypse-catalog string\n    \tcompiled apocalypse.ctp table (phase clock, operations, gates, rewards, duty skills) (default \"configs/apocalypse.generated.json\")\n  -attunement-fixed-tilt int\n    \t固定池倾斜幅度：普通/稀有各减这么多百分比权重，减掉的按高档现有比例补（1..99）。0 = 不动固定池；只在 -attunement-rebalance 打开时生效 (default 25)\n  -attunement-rebalance\n    \t本私服的掉落调参（**与官服的显式差异**）：征兆「无事发生」减半、fixed 池低档按比例向高档倾斜。见 internal/loot/attunement_rebalance.go\n  -attunement-rewards string\n    \tboundary-of-attunement reward table generated from the source rewardboostinfo CTPs\n  -bag-rules string\n    \tseparate bag slot and missing stack limit policy (default \"configs/inventory.compat90.json\")\n  -bleeding-mine-rewards string\n    \t赤红铁矿原版奖励表；默认读取掉落目录旁的 bleeding-mine-rewards.json\n  -booster-catalog string\n    \tbooster definitions JSON\n  -booster-gage-hide\n    \tsend NOTI398 booster-gage with displayValue=0 on town entry to hide the top-left Liberation Trace panel; disable with -booster-gage-hide=false or DFO_BOOSTER_GAGE=0 (default true)\n  -boxes string\n    \timported open-box content tables; empty resolves boxes.json beside the bag rules\n  -card-rules string\n    \tseparate compatible free-card policy (default \"configs/cards.compat90.json\")\n  -channel-identity\n    \tcandidate: synchronize NOTI2435 and all actor contexts with the connected channel\n  -channel-refresh-config string\n    \tseparate local channel directory service for native refresh\n  -character-catalog string\n    \tPVF-derived profession catalog (default \"configs/characters.generated.json\")\n  -character-rules string\n    \texplicit local bootstrap settings (default \"configs/character-probe.json\")\n  -character-storage string\n    \tenable experimental persisted character handling with this local storage config\n  -entry-addition-probe\n    \tsend current-build source attributes; optional inventory and skills remain pending\n  -entry-basic-probe\n    \tsend experimental current-build minimum actor info after SELECT; does not initialize a town\n  -equipment-catalog string\n    \tsource equipment catalog a run selects gear from; required whenever loot is enabled\n  -equipment-craft-confirm-variant int\n    \tCMD2259 第二步应答的子分支字节\n  -equipment-craft-confirm-window int\n    \tCMD2259 第二步（确定）应答的窗口选择字节\n  -equipment-craft-execute\n    \tCMD2259 是否执行装备生成（扣成本 + 发装备） (default true)\n  -equipment-craft-execute-on string\n    \tCMD2259 何时执行装备生成：confirm / first / never (default \"confirm\")\n  -equipment-craft-generate-variant int\n    \tCMD2259 装备生成应答的子分支字节（1 = 只落成功标志、不动窗口状态，默认；0 = 强制 setState 到状态 3，会让材料切换按钮失灵） (default 1)\n  -equipment-craft-generate-window int\n    \tCMD2259 装备生成（[12]=0）应答的窗口选择字节\n  -equipment-craft-variant int\n    \tCMD2259 应答的子分支字节（仅当窗口字节为 0 时生效）\n  -equipment-craft-window int\n    \tCMD2259 应答的窗口选择字节（非 0 → 窗口 3937；0 → 窗口 2145） (default 1)\n  -equipment-create-cost string\n    \t装备生成成本表（[create cost] 的导出物）；留空则第二步只回窗口\n  -equipment-full-catalog string\n    \tseparate indexed wear catalog prefix; does not widen drops\n  -equipment-journal-rules string\n    \t装备库规则表（equipmentsetjournal.cos 的导出物）；留空则不登记\n  -equipment-transform string\n    \tCMD2259 action=1（装备变换）如何执行：apply（真的换装）/ observe（只记日志） (default \"apply\")\n  -equipment-wear-rules string\n    \tcurrent-client equipment slots and persistent wear handling\n  -fatigue-free\n    \t关闭疲劳消耗（进本与房间一起归零）；默认关\n  -fatigue-rules string\n    \tseparate persisted fatigue and rollover policy (default: configs/fatigue-probe.json) (default \"configs/fatigue-probe.json\")\n  -fixture string\n    \tverified-format server fixture to send after accept\n  -game-listen string\n    \tgame endpoint; use 0.0.0.0:PORT to accept clients from other machines (default \"127.0.0.1:0\")\n  -item-index string\n    \tfull stackable item index JSON (e.g. configs/items.index.json)\n  -item-shop string\n    \tsource item shop JSON (itemshop/**.shp; prices goods with [need material], e.g. the Odyssey shop's silver coins)\n  -knight-shield-catalog string\n    \toptional source-verified shield window side-car; relative to wear rules directory, empty disables (default \"equipment-knight-shield.full-candidate.json\")\n  -loot-catalog string\n    \tcurrent gold/ordinary stackable source projection; equipment pending\n  -loot-rules string\n    \texplicit reference drop formula policy (default \"configs/drop.compat90.json\")\n  -moon-solo-config string\n    \topt-in Moon Lake solo candidate, explicitly validated 2.38.3.25 profile\n  -oath-grades string\n    \t诊断覆盖：固定下发的引子/誓约档位 primer,oath（见 oath_info.go）。留空 = 按角色穿戴的誓约/引子装备算，这是正常路径\n  -oath-grades-from-gear\n    \t诊断：按角色穿戴的誓约/引子装备算档位（旧规则）。默认关 —— 客户端脱不下誓约槽，穿上 primeval 就永久 oath=45\n  -oath-grades-table string\n    \t誓约/引子装备稀有度表（cmd/oathgradeimport 生成）；只在 -oath-grades-from-gear 打开时用\n  -oath-inject string\n    \t诊断用：向客户端注入任意 noti 的候选列表，形式 id:size:fill;off:val,...（见 oath_probe.go）；默认空 = 关闭\n  -oath-progress-clears int\n    \t隐藏 BOSS 的保底场次：-oath-progress-dungeons 里的副本通关这么多场后，下一场下发 oath=45（必出一次）并在通关时归零；<=0 关闭保底 (default 5)\n  -oath-progress-dungeons string\n    \t计入保底的副本号，逗号分隔（默认只有小深渊 100005014） (default \"100005014\")\n  -omen-hold int\n    \t诊断：把玩家直接放到指定征兆阶段(0-4)，-1 = 不动；会写回角色存档 (default -1)\n  -omen-info string\n    \t诊断：直接指定 noti 2836「征兆队伍状态」的 69 字节载荷，用来点亮征兆 UI 并实测字段语义。写法见 cmd/wireprobe/omen_info.go；留空 = 按角色存档里的真实档数生成\n  -output string\n    \tcapture directory (default \"runtime/wireprobe\")\n  -progression-catalog string\n    \tcurrent-source experience and growth catalog\n  -progression-rules string\n    \tseparate reference compatibility formula settings (default \"configs/experience.compat90.json\")\n  -pvf-archive string\n    \texplicit inner PVF path for candidate domains\n  -pvf-box-policy string\n    \tenabled COS/box scope and existing placement defaults; rewards from native material bindings (default \"configs/pvf-box-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-cache-dir string\n    \tderived PVF cache directory; - disables caching (default \"runtime/pvf-cache\")\n  -pvf-catalogs string\n    \tcandidate direct-read domains: world,quests,progression,items,equipment,periods,skins,journal,create-cost,skills,prices,materials,boosters,tutorial,enhancements,random-options,shields,oath-grades,vault,loot,equipment-selection,town,dungeons,training-dungeons,tutorial-dungeons,dungeon-towers,dungeon-hell,dungeon-maze,apocalypse,attunement,odyssey-growth,odyssey-chapters,odyssey-weapons,odyssey-drop,odyssey-currency,clear-cube,black-purgatory,bleeding-mine,dungeon-terminal,dungeon-tournament,selection-boxes,lottery,adventure,adventure-recommended,season,odyssey-routes,roster-backgrounds,fame,script-warps,layer-revisits,characters,cashshop,boxes,item-shops; empty keeps JSON\n  -pvf-character-policy string\n    \tsaved source identity and default shortcut behavior; profession source fields from PVF (default \"configs/pvf-character-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-check-catalogs\n    \tprepare explicitly selected PVF catalogs and exit before storage, listeners or runtime setup\n  -pvf-check-heap-profile string\n    \twrite a new post-GC heap profile only with pvf-check-catalogs\n  -pvf-content-policy string\n    \toptional special-content policy; empty preserves empty policy, source tables from PVF\n  -pvf-drop-policy string\n    \texisting basic equipment allowlist and maximum loot grade; source rules from PVF (default \"configs/pvf-drop-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-enhancement-policy string\n    \tindependent enhancement server policies; required only for PVF enhancements (default \"configs/pvf-enhancement-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-item-shop-policy string\n    \texisting service shop routes and purchase-limit policy; offers from native SHP (default \"configs/pvf-item-shop-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-layer-revisit-policy string\n    \tverified layer revisit scope, record and cache restoration; source maps and landing from PVF (default \"configs/pvf-layer-revisit-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-lottery-policy string\n    \tdeprecated compatibility flag; PVF lottery scope is discovered from source and this path is ignored\n  -pvf-scene-policy string\n    \tindependent entry town and training dungeon selection; source rules from PVF (default \"configs/pvf-scene-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-script-warp-policy string\n    \tverified script warp scope and witnessed transition records; source routes from PVF (default \"configs/pvf-script-warp-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-selection-policy string\n    \toptional selection box whitelist; empty discovers scope from PVF\n  -pvf-sha256 string\n    \texpected inner PVF SHA256; must match existing character source\n  -pvf-vault-policy string\n    \tclient capacity/save policy independent of PVF account vault table (default \"configs/pvf-vault-policy.json\")\n  -pvf-verify-baselines\n    \tcompare selected PVF domains with JSON baselines before storage; false removes the selected JSON startup dependency\n  -quest-catalog string\n    \tenable source quest accept/abandon persistence; objectives and rewards are separate\n  -quest-equipment-catalog string\n    \tsource basic-equipment metadata for atomic quest rewards\n  -random-option-catalog string\n    \tcurrent-client magic-seal random option rules; enables CMD393 unsealing\n  -responses string\n    \tJSON mapping command IDs to response fixture paths\n  -scale-death-from-hp\n    \t诊断：定盘机关血量触底时由服务端兜底宣布死亡（默认关；noti 2838 修好后天平会自己死）\n  -select-probe-config string\n    \topt in to current-build SELECT parser experiment; does not initialize a town\n  -selection-boxes string\n    \tsource selection box JSON ([booster select category] boxes)\n  -shop-prices string\n    \tsource NPC prices; empty resolves shop-prices.json beside the loot catalog\n  -shop-release\n    \tenable accepted ordinary shop in release profile\n  -skill-catalog string\n    \tcurrent PVF learning metadata; enables manual learning and persisted skill slots\n  -skill-lock-offset int\n    \toverride the subtype 19 skill lock offset inside the character option block (default 2736) (default -1)\n  -solo-party-bootstrap\n    \tinitialize the owned actor in the current solo party roster\n  -town-catalog string\n    \tPVF-derived town-area catalog for the entry experiment\n  -town-entry-probe string\n    \topt in to experimental town entry using this separate spawn policy\n  -tutorial-dungeons string\n    \tsource starting-route dungeon catalog\n  -tutorial-routes string\n    \tsource per-job starting route table\n  -unified-charac-template string\n    \toverride the built-in 3539 byte character option block sent as NOTI2827 (different client build only)\n  -vault-purchase-candidate\n    \tenable isolated vault purchase candidate\n  -vault-purchase-release\n    \tenable accepted personal vault purchases in release profile\n  -vault-rules string\n    \tsource vault capacity and empty-state initialization\n  -world-catalog string\n    \tenable source-backed town transitions and saved positions\n  -world-rules string\n    \tseparate world movement policy (default \"configs/world-probe.json\")\n"
